--- !u!114 &2004682469
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2004682465}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e429127c70682442ba479e71c0ef3d4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1674203232}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 776701739}
  dialogue:
  - Hey.
  - Wait.
  - I don't recognize you and you have color?
  - You must be from a different island, right?
  - Are you strong?
  - Please help us.
  - Here's how it happened
  - You see me and this island in black and white?
  - In fact, everything used to be as colorful as usual.
  - But the one who did something like this is "Demon Lord V".
  - That guy stole the colors from everyone and this island in order to make himself
    stronger.
  - But that guy was incredibly strong...
  - No one can defeat it.
  - Because it also has two incredibly strong left and right hands 'Durandal' and
    'Frigra'.
  - Those who ever dared to challenge them met a terrifying end.
  - Huh...? What did you say? You're asking why everyone hasn't escape from the island?
  - That's because when humans have their color stolen, their bodies will instantly
    disintegrate when exposed to sunlight.
  - Please.
  - "Please help me\u2026 and everyone on the island."
  - What?! Really?!
  - Thank you for agreeing to help me. You're a really good person.
  - In that case, before we dive in, let me take you to get used to your body on
    this island first.
  - Follow me.
  contButton: {fileID: 1377707730}
  wordSpeed: 0.02
  playerIsClose: 0
  interactPrompt: {fileID: 379494646}
  sceneToLoad: TutorialRoom
  playerObject: {fileID: 1596395913}
  scriptsToDisable:
  - PlayerMovement
  - PlayerAttack
